Error [E0110]: A `loop` condition must be Bool (true or false), but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/loop_cond_not_bool.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     loop 3 -> print("hello")
    |          ^
 Why: The program needs a clear yes or no here
 Fix: Compare the value to something, e.g. `x > 0` or `name == "ok"`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0110

